Package: naves
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: terrain generator and map editor for DayZ
 Náves turns OpenStreetMap and elevation data into DayZ terrains: it builds
 the heightmap and surface layers and packs a signed mod that a DayZ server
 can load.
 .
 Building terrains needs bzed's armake2 fork and DayZ Tools under Proton.
